    "long_instructions": "<h1>\r\nReviewing AI Tutor's Changes\r\n</h1>\r\n<p>\r\nPrompt AI Tutor to update the hero section with:\r\n</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A dark background</li>\r\n<li>White text</li>\r\n<li>More padding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>\r\nAfter AI Tutor generates the code, accept the changes. Afterwards, type the new background, text color, and padding values in the description box.</p>",
